{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Instances"}, {"ns": 14, "title": "Category:NPCs"}], "contentmodel": "wikitext", "pagelanguage": "en", "pagelanguagehtmlcode": "en", "pagelanguagedir": "ltr", "touched": "2026-05-09T01:06:28Z", "lastrevid": 11143, "length": 122, "new": true, "fullurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:NPCs_by_instance", "editurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:NPCs_by_instance?action=edit", "canonicalurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:NPCs_by_instance"}, {"pageid": 3447, "ns": 14, "title": "Category:NPCs", "revisions": [{"revid": 11144, "parentid": 0, "user": "Aeliren", "timestamp": "2025-08-31T22:11:11Z", "slots": {"main": {"contentmodel": "wikitext", "contentformat": "text/x-wiki", "content": "Articles about interactive NPCs in World of Warcraft. This list should exclude non-interactive creatures or mobs, including named mobs and bosses, which have their own categories.\n\nNPCs should be placed in their proper NPC subcategory - specific trainer type, vendor, innkeeper, stable master, riding instructor, weapon master, information giver, flight master, banker, battlemaster, auctioneer, guild master, and/or quest giver.\n\nIf the NPC fits in none of these categories, but still counts as being interactive in some way, it can be placed in the base category.\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Gameplay]]"}}}], "categories": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Characters"}, {"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Gameplay"}], "contentmodel": "wikitext", "pagelanguage": "en", "pagelanguagehtmlcode": "en", "pagelanguagedir": "ltr", "touched": "2026-08-20T21:51:53Z", "lastrevid": 11144, "length": 612, "new": true, "fullurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:NPCs", "editurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:NPCs?action=edit", "canonicalurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:NPCs"}, {"pageid": 3448, "ns": 14, "title": "Category:Mobs", "revisions": [{"revid": 11145, "parentid": 0, "user": "Aeliren", "timestamp": "2025-08-31T22:14:36Z", "slots": {"main": {"contentmodel": "wikitext", "contentformat": "text/x-wiki", "content": "This category entails articles describing certain monsters ([[mob]]s) that share a common name with several others rather than having a unique name or title. They are different from [[NPC]]s because they are non-interactive, and exist solely for the purpose of being killed. These are the meat and bones of [[PvE]], and permeate the WoW universe.\n\nNOTE:\n* Bosses can be considered mobs, but should be put into their own category, '''[[:Category:Bosses]]'''.\n* Interactive NPCs should go into the appropriate subcategory (or subcategories) of '''[[:Category:NPCs]]''' rather than this category.\n\n[[Category:NPCs]]\n[[Category:Gameplay]]"}}}], "categories": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Gameplay"}, {"ns": 14, "title": "Category:NPCs"}], "contentmodel": "wikitext", "pagelanguage": "en", "pagelanguagehtmlcode": "en", "pagelanguagedir": "ltr", "touched": "2025-12-04T23:35:16Z", "lastrevid": 11145, "length": 634, "new": true, "fullurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Mobs", "editurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Mobs?action=edit", "canonicalurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Mobs"}, {"pageid": 3628, "ns": 14, "title": "Category:Northwind", "revisions": [{"revid": 11484, "parentid": 0, "user": "Aeliren", "timestamp": "2025-09-01T20:52:41Z", "slots": {"main": {"contentmodel": "wikitext", "contentformat": "text/x-wiki", "content": "This category contains articles related to the [[Northwind]] zone.\n\n[[Category:Eastern Kingdoms]]"}}}], "categories": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Eastern Kingdoms"}], "contentmodel": "wikitext", "pagelanguage": "en", "pagelanguagehtmlcode": "en", "pagelanguagedir": "ltr", "touched": "2026-08-28T19:29:23Z", "lastrevid": 11484, "length": 97, "new": true, "fullurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Northwind", "editurl": "https://turtle-wow.fandom.com/wiki/Cate